# QuestQuiz runtime (Railway / Docker / local).

# Process binding:
# PORT=8080                 # Railway injects this automatically
# HOST=0.0.0.0              # required on Railway (default in npm start)
# SKIP_BUILD=1              # set in Docker image (public/ already built)

# Local preview only:
# PORT=43123
# HOST=127.0.0.1

# --- Persistent account store ---
# Railway: create a Volume, mount it at /data, keep DATA_DIR=/data (Dockerfile default).
# Without a volume, accounts live on the container filesystem and are lost on redeploy.
# DATA_DIR=/data

# --- Email verification (Resend) — required for parent / student 13+ signup ---
# Codes are generated on the server and emailed. They are never shown in the UI.
#
# 1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
# 2. Create an API key → paste as RESEND_API_KEY in Railway Variables
# 3. Verify your domain in Resend and set EMAIL_FROM
#
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxx
# EMAIL_FROM=QuestQuiz <noreply@learnassessment.com>

# --- Admin bootstrap (optional but recommended) ---
# On first boot, creates/updates a platform admin so you can approve school registrations.
# ADMIN_EMAIL=you@learnassessment.com
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=choose-a-strong-password

# Optional: Railway CLI
# RAILWAY_TOKEN=
